    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19292" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαμβαίνω</span></b> , onomatop. word, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chatter with the teeth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.375
			</span></i>; <i>stammer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Bion
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.272
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Arc.Praef.</u>
			</span></i>:—so also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαμβᾰκύζω</span></b> , <i>chatter with cold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				17
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαμβᾰλύζω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.54B.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; possibly to be restored (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βομβυλιάζω</span>) in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				949a13
			</span></i>.</div>
